\section*{README: COSE + PVP + Codex Verification Architecture}
\label{readme}

\subsection*{1. Overview}

This repository contains the full LaTeX source for the hybrid
Computational Organism Simulation Engine (COSE), the Proof Validation
Pipeline (PVP), and the Codex cryptographic provenance system.

The manuscript is organized into modular chapters, each of which can be
compiled independently or as part of the unified white paper.

\begin{itemize}
    \item COSE: Hybrid biochemical--neural--spatial dynamical engine.
    \item PVP: Automated theorem proving + SNARK verification pipeline.
    \item Codex: Immutable provenance and capsule registry.
\end{itemize}

All chapters are written in standard \LaTeX{} using \texttt{amsmath},
\texttt{amssymb}, and \texttt{amsthm}.

