\subsection*{3. Compilation Instructions}

Compile using \texttt{pdflatex} or \texttt{lualatex}:

\begin{verbatim}
pdflatex main.tex
pdflatex main.tex
\end{verbatim}

Two passes are recommended for cross-references and theorem numbering.

